{"id": "34038", "title": "狂恋佳人", "author": "安琪", "category": "文学名著", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34038.htm", "intro": "杜诗诗从小就立志要嫁给炘乔哥哥。好不容易终于熬到长大成人，可以成为美丽的新娘，怎料，他竟避她如蛇蝎，抵死不接受她！哼哼，她等了这么多年，怎么可能让他就此溜走？为了他们美好的将来，那就从同居开始吧！陆炘乔真搞不懂，现在的女孩子到底在想什么？她居然从小娃娃时，就嚷著要嫁给他！开什么玩笑，他又没恋童癖，怎么可能会喜欢她？！没想到多年后再见，她竟蜕变成一个惑人心神的美女，还联合他的父母，设计两人同居──即便他坚守立场，却发现自己竟逐渐沉沦在她的魅惑中……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34038", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2164807.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2164808.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2164809.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2164810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2164811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2164812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2164813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2164814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2164815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2164816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2164817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2164818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2164819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2164820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2164821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2164822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2164823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2164824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2164825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2164826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2164827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2164828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2164829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2164830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2164831.h